 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "方向都写对了，金库就安全了吗？不一定。",
   "spoken": "方向都写对了，金库就安全了吗？不一定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.112
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "ERC-4626 的份额公式是：存入资产，乘以总份额，除以总资产。",
   "spoken": "ERC-4626 的份额公式是：存入资产，乘以总份额，除以总资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.188,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 6.286,
   "speechEnd": 11.286
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "结果向下取整。这一步方向没错。",
   "spoken": "结果向下取整。这一步方向没错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.336,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 12.434,
   "speechEnd": 15.384
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "麻烦在总资产。它通常直接读金库的代币余额。",
   "spoken": "麻烦在总资产。它通常直接读金库的代币余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.444,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 16.542,
   "speechEnd": 20.539
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "而余额，任何人都能通过直接转账来增加。",
   "spoken": "而余额，任何人都能通过直接转账来增加。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.608,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 21.706,
   "speechEnd": 25.11
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "看攻击怎么走。金库是空的。",
   "spoken": "看攻击怎么走。金库是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.172,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 26.27,
   "speechEnd": 28.743
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第一步，攻击者存入 1 wei，拿到 1 份额。",
   "spoken": "第一步，攻击者存入 1 wei，拿到 1 份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.8,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 29.898,
   "speechEnd": 33.029
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "第二步，攻击者不走存款函数，直接往金库转入 1 万 USDC。",
   "spoken": "第二步，攻击者不走存款函数，直接往金库转入 1 万 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.076,
   "dur": 5.952,
   "speechStart": 34.174,
   "speechEnd": 39.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "现在总份额只有 1，总资产是 1 万 USDC，再加 1 个最小单位。",
   "spoken": "现在总份额只有 1，总资产是 1 万 USDC，再加 1 个最小单位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.248,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 40.346,
   "speechEnd": 45.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第三步，受害者存入 9999 USDC。",
   "spoken": "第三步，受害者存入 9999 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 46.3,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 46.398,
   "speechEnd": 50.267
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "他的份额，是 9999 USDC 乘以 1，除以略多于 1 万 USDC。",
   "spoken": "他的份额，是 9999 USDC 乘以 1，除以略多于 1 万 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 51.32,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 51.418,
   "speechEnd": 57.299
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "结果小于 1，向下取整，是 0。",
   "spoken": "结果小于 1，向下取整，是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 58.356,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 58.454,
   "speechEnd": 61.394
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "受害者的资产进了金库，却一份也没拿到。",
   "spoken": "受害者的资产进了金库，却一份也没拿到。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 62.44,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 62.538,
   "speechEnd": 66.002
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "第四步，攻击者赎回那 1 份额，取回约 19999 USDC。",
   "spoken": "第四步，攻击者赎回那 1 份额，取回约 19999 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 67.076,
   "dur": 6.504,
   "speechStart": 67.174,
   "speechEnd": 72.745
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "这 1 份额，代表了金库的全部资产。受害者的存款，等于捐给了它。",
   "spoken": "这 1 份额，代表了金库的全部资产。受害者的存款，等于捐给了它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 73.8,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 73.898,
   "speechEnd": 79.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "攻击者通常会抢跑受害者的第一笔存款交易。",
   "spoken": "攻击者通常会抢跑受害者的第一笔存款交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 80.476,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 80.574,
   "speechEnd": 83.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "攻击成本，就是捐赠额。受害者的存款接近捐赠额，攻击就有利可图。",
   "spoken": "攻击成本，就是捐赠额。受害者的存款接近捐赠额，攻击就有利可图。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 84.968,
   "dur": 7.464,
   "speechStart": 85.066,
   "speechEnd": 91.599
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "成立条件也要说清：金库必须几乎是空的。",
   "spoken": "成立条件也要说清：金库必须几乎是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 92.652,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 92.75,
   "speechEnd": 95.964
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "金库规模越大，攻击成本越高。",
   "spoken": "金库规模越大，攻击成本越高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 97.024,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 97.122,
   "speechEnd": 99.622
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "换成披萨店：第一个顾客买下整张披萨，只切成 1 块。",
   "spoken": "换成披萨店：第一个顾客买下整张披萨，只切成 1 块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 100.676,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 100.774,
   "speechEnd": 105.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "然后往盒子里偷偷塞进 100 张披萨。",
   "spoken": "然后往盒子里偷偷塞进 100 张披萨。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 106.224,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 106.322,
   "speechEnd": 109.119
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "下一个顾客付了 99 张的钱，因为 1 块披萨值 101 张，他一块也分不到。",
   "spoken": "下一个顾客付了 99 张的钱，因为 1 块披萨值 101 张，他一块也分不到。",
